## Proposed supplier-first scope

The candidate IDs below are proposals for the builder, not minted production IDs. Keep page and item IDs stable once the integrated inventory adopts them. Build A/B pairs in this order, with an examples page after each main page. Each item contract should name every exact supplier and explain the actual use.

