| 1 | `aqft-eft-foundations` / `aqft-eft-foundations-examples` | EFT data, scales, Wilsonian action, finite heavy matching; consume only the needed `qft-c01`, `qft-f01`, and exact `qftx-heavy-field-eft` item interfaces. |
