The previously harvested Warsaw-basis paper by Grzadkowski et al. is not used to claim a complete dimension-six basis or a count: the assigned scope is the generic finite relation quotient, and the source note records only its abstract and introduction as previously inspected. No SMEFT enumeration is inferred.

