+      locator: "§2.1, printed pp. 13–15, redundant-interaction argument and equations (21)–(26): integration by parts and removal of a leading-equation interaction at one retained order."
+    - title: "Juan Carlos Criado and Manuel Pérez-Victoria, Field redefinitions in effective theories at higher orders"
+      url: "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1811.09413"
+      locator: "§3, printed pp. 9–12, equations (3.1)–(3.8), and §5.1, printed pp. 16–19, equations (5.1)–(5.3): EOM limitations and the higher-order terms generated by a local field redefinition."
