+---
+id: ex-aqft-scalar-gauge-operator-power-counting
+kind: example
+title: A finite-order SU(2) scalar operator contract
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
